# USR (inflection) case on one card, NOT run by this package (no card-hours were named for it).
# Lines for harness/bin/nrpic-run submit --launcher batch --exe <athena_gpu> --list <this file>
# (one Slurm job per group; the cards are shared: at most two jobs of the owner queued).
# Estimated cost on one A100 from core's measurement (1.23 s per step at 256^3 with sources
# and the constraint record every step; scalar_field_2.md section 6), Courant 0.25:
#   64^3: 426 steps, ~10 s;  128^3: 852 steps, ~2.5 min;  256^3: 1702 steps, ~35 min
#   (0.58 card-hours) plus 21 dumps of 2.3 GB (48 GB) at dump_dt = 0.5.
# Group 1 (ladder at k_max/dk = 8, the convergence set-up of P1:756; odd/even pairs):
